SUMMARY:Brunch & Beats w/DJ Aziz Vora
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nBrunch & Beats is bringing the u
 ltimate Sunday funday to Haiku — a stunning Japanese-inspired venue feat
 uring a zen garden\, unique design\, and an incredible boutique sound syst
 em experience. Expect daytime dancing\, live multi-genre DJ sets\, food\, 
 vendors\, and a fun social atmosphere with great people. Whether you want 
 to dance\, relax\, or just enjoy the vibe\, this should be a really unique
  Asheville event.\n\nDJ Aziz\, an amazing house DJ\, will be playing. They
  will also have some other performers with other genres of music.\n\nWe ma
 y not stay the whole time so come earlier if you want to hang.\n\nGet tick
 ets here ($30): [https://posh.vip/e/brunch-and-beats-2026](https://posh.vi
 p/e/brunch-and-beats-2026)
