SUMMARY:Asheville Honeyfest at Highland Brewing Co.
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nLet's celebrate the sweetness of
  summer at the 5th Annual Asheville Honeyfest! We'll meet at the Meadow at
  Highland Brewing Co. where you'll find live music\, food trucks\, local v
 endors and\, of course\, plenty of honey to taste. Proceeds from the festi
 val support honeybee research\, and there will be a global honey tasting c
 ompetition where you can sample honeys from around the world.\n\nHope to s
 ee you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/20s-30s-40s-friendly-people-do-cool-s
 tuff/events/314594147/
